Package: com.mody-iq.moodfacebook
Name: MooDfacebook
Version: 2.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Facebook enhancement tweak for RootHide: removes sponsored posts, hides People You May Know and the Reels carousel, confirms likes, downloads photos/videos/Reels/Stories on long press or via button, hides the Reels overlay, and lets you watch Stories without leaving a seen receipt.
Maintainer: mody-iq
Author: Mody
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Homepage: https://github.com/mody-iq/MooDfacebook
